# chorus golden vector: controller command (volume step), protocol v2 message type 0x32.
#
# Committed, and never written by a test. Any implementation of chorus protocol v2 must
# produce these exact bytes from the canonical input in controller_command_volume.fields, and recover
# exactly those fields from them (docs/protocol.md, "Version 2").
#
# Format: whitespace separated hex bytes, '#' starts a comment.

# frame header: type 0x32, payload length 4 (0x0004), big-endian
32 00 04

# command = 7 (volume_step)
07

# value = -5
FF FB

# target: length 0 (only join names one)
00
